{"1929610":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Demonologist","steam_appid":1929610,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/e04258592ab7813dbf281ff230d40cf3.avif?t=1784902884\" width=600 height=132 \/><\/span><br>더 쉬버스는 최대 4인, 최소 1인과 함께 플레이할 수 있는 협동 공포 게임입니다. 목표는 팀과 함께 또는 혼자서 장비를 사용하여 저주받은 장소의 악령 유형을 탐지하는 것입니다.<br><br><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/57acbbaf692f8ed17a8d0cc17c56a8f0.webp?t=1784902884\" width=174 height=32 \/><\/span> <br>지금까지 플레이한 협동 호러 장르 중 최고의 그래픽. 언리얼 엔진 5로 개발.<\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/c41914cd04f32eaa95c49352a15ab5d5.poster.avif?t=1784902884\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/c41914cd04f32eaa95c49352a15ab5d5.mp4?t=1784902884\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/8865c783cc3b2461fd40923050aff09a.webp?t=1784902884\" width=167 height=31 \/><\/span> <br>모든 게임에서 무작위 이벤트와 유령을 만나게 됩니다. <\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/5a96a48e09ab6c4f48afd57c6971d0cd.poster.avif?t=1784902884\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1929610\/extras\/5a96a48e09ab6c4f48afd57c6971d0cd.mp4?t=1784902884\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\